WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
Hoshanot has day-specific practices and community

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.040
customs.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.180
Join the correct local order.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.580
A supportive group helps participation without erasing

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.960
differences between traditions.
